---
import ConsiliumCaseLayout from '../../../layouts/ConsiliumCaseLayout.astro';
const months=[['JAN','171','€2.91'],['FEB','43','€3.91'],['MAR','96','€5.13'],['APR','198','€3.23'],['MAY','160','€3.50'],['JUN','144','€3.82'],['JUL','122','€4.73'],['AUG','111','€6.03'],['SEP','84','€7.93'],['OCT','81','€7.01'],['NOV','99','€4.12'],['DEC','175','€2.66']];
---
<ConsiliumCaseLayout title="Consilium Medicum Meta Ads case" description="1,484 Meta Ads enquiries for Consilium Medicum in 2025 at a weighted average €4.22 per enquiry." eyebrow="META ADS" headline="1,484 enquiries" accent="in one year." intro="Search captures people already looking. Meta creates another entry point: put the right medical service in front of the right audience and make the first step easy enough to take now." metrics={[{value:'1,484',label:'Meta enquiries · 2025'},{value:'€4.22',label:'weighted average CPL · 2025'},{value:'198',label:'best month · April'},{value:'12 mo',label:'full-year reporting'}]}>
<section class="case-section shell"><div class="two"><span class="eyebrow">THE ROLE OF META</span><div><h2>Not every patient starts<br/>with a Google search.</h2><p class="statement">Meta gave the clinic a second acquisition engine alongside search and organic demand.</p><p>The creative and offer have to do more work here: explain why a service matters, create enough relevance to stop the scroll and reduce friction between interest and enquiry.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="year"><div class="shell"><div class="yearhead"><span class="eyebrow">2025 / MONTH BY MONTH</span><h2>Not one viral month.<br/>A full year of enquiries.</h2></div><div class="chart">{months.map((m,i)=><div class="barrow"><span>{m[0]}</span><div class="track"><i style={`width:${Number(m[1])/198*100}%`}></i></div><strong>{m[1]}</strong><small>{m[2]} CPL</small></div>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="case-section dark"><div class="shell two"><span class="eyebrow">PATIENT JOURNEY</span><div><h2>From interruption<br/>to conversation.</h2><div class="data-list"><div class="data-row"><span>Creative</span><span>A medical problem, service or offer has to earn attention in-feed.</span><strong>01</strong></div><div class="data-row"><span>Interest</span><span>The patient understands enough to consider the clinic before actively searching for it.</span><strong>02</strong></div><div class="data-row"><span>Lead</span><span>The first action is deliberately simple: submit an enquiry and start a conversation.</span><strong>03</strong></div><div class="data-row"><span>Clinic</span><span>From this point, speed and quality of administrator follow-up determine what happens next.</span><strong>04</strong></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="case-section shell"><div class="two"><span class="eyebrow">2026 / FINAL MONTHS</span><div><h2>The channel was still<br/>producing when the project ended.</h2><p class="statement">January–February 2026: 406 Meta enquiries at a weighted €2.63 CPL.</p><p>The Consilium partnership ended in 2026. We show the final available project data rather than presenting the clinic as a current RM client.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="accent-section"><div class="shell"><span class="eyebrow">RESULT</span><h2>1,484 Meta enquiries in 2025.<br/>Another 406 in Jan–Feb 2026.</h2><div class="flow"><span>CREATIVE</span><b>→</b><span>INTEREST</span><b>→</b><span>LEAD</span><b>→</b><span>ADMINISTRATOR</span><b>→</b><span>PATIENT JOURNEY</span></div></div></section>
</ConsiliumCaseLayout>
<style>.year{background:#e8e7e1;padding:130px 0}.yearhead{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.45fr 1.2fr;gap:50px}.yearhead h2{font-size:clamp(48px,6.5vw,94px);line-height:.92;letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:0}.chart{margin-top:80px;border-top:1px solid #aaa}.barrow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:55px 1fr 70px 90px;gap:18px;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;padding:13px 0;font:10px monospace}.track{height:8px;background:#d1d0ca}.track i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--accent)}.barrow strong{font-size:18px}.barrow small{text-align:right;color:#666}@media(max-width:800px){.year{padding:90px 0}.yearhead{grid-template-columns:1fr}.barrow{grid-template-columns:45px 1fr 55px}.barrow small{grid-column:2/-1;text-align:left}}</style>